                        <span class="approach-number">01</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approach-body">
                        <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; margin-bottom: 6px;">STEP 01</div>
                        <h3>Understand the Business</h3>
                        <p>Review the product portfolio, manufacturing process, production capacity and business objectives.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 2 -->
                <div class="approach-card">
                    <div class="approach-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="assets/service_quality_audit.jpg" alt="Analyse the Current System" loading="lazy">
                        <span class="approach-number">02</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approach-body">
                        <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; margin-bottom: 6px;">STEP 02</div>
                        <h3>Analyse the Current System</h3>
                        <p>Evaluate costs, process flows, resource utilisation, wastage and operational controls.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 3 -->
                <div class="approach-card">
                    <div class="approach-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="assets/packaging_consultant.jpg" alt="Develop an Action Plan" loading="lazy">
                        <span class="approach-number">03</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approach-body">
                        <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; margin-bottom: 6px;">STEP 03</div>
                        <h3>Develop an Action Plan</h3>
                        <p>Identify improvement priorities and recommend practical, measurable corrective actions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 4 -->
                <div class="approach-card">
                    <div class="approach-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="assets/service_mis_dashboard.jpg" alt="Establish Monitoring Systems" loading="lazy">
                        <span class="approach-number">04</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="approach-body">
                        <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; margin-bottom: 6px;">STEP 04</div>
                        <h3>Establish Monitoring Systems</h3>
                        <p>Define relevant cost indicators, reports and review mechanisms to help management track progress.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>



